    given-names: Maurice
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6397-4759"
    affiliation: SURF
# version mirrors pyproject.toml's current package version. This project has no
# tagged GitHub release or Zenodo deposition yet, so date-released and doi are
# intentionally omitted rather than guessed — fill them in once the first
# release/deposition exists (see the zenodo-github-release-sync skill).
version: 0.1.0
url: "https://surf-ori.github.io/sprouts/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/surf-ori/sprouts"
license: EUPL-1.2
keywords:
  - DuckLake
  - open research information
  - research data lakehouse
  - OpenAlex
  - OpenAIRE
  - CRIS
  - OpenAPC
  - Netherlands
  - PID
  - open science
abstract: >-
  A light-weight data lakehouse for open research information, built on
  DuckLake. Combines several open scholarly datasets — OpenAlex, the OpenAIRE
  Graph, Dutch institutional CRIS records, OpenAPC, and a Dutch-organisations
  reference table — into one queryable DuckLake catalog, plus a standalone
  browser app to explore it without installing anything.
